♪ Its author unpublished it; ♪

110
00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.320
♪ Thousands of builds failed. ♪

111
00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.300
♪ Many never saw it: ♪

112
00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.390
♪ A dependency, deep down. ♪

113
00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.470
♪ When eslint-scope was hijacked, ♪

114
00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.560
♪ Its new release stole tokens. ♪

115
00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.640
♪ Write trivial code yourself; ♪

116
00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.720
♪ Keep dependencies few: ♪

117
00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.460
♪ Each one can break, be hijacked, ♪

118
00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.020
♪ Or vanish out of view. ♪

119
00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.980
♪ But code that's hard to get right, ♪

120
00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:54.350
