139
00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:21.710
♪ It worked where it was built, ♪

140
00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.720
♪ And failed where it was sent: ♪

141
00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.440
♪ Its assumption didn't hold. ♪

142
00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.440
♪ Identify violated assumptions: ♪

143
00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.060
♪ Read the docs and read the code, ♪

144
00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.520
♪ Check what it was built for, ♪

145
00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.730
♪ Then test it where it goes. ♪

146
00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.960
