196
00:12:35.961 --> 00:12:43.981
(narrator) On the casebook's cover, five case bricks stack into one build: reuse done right, and the foreman, carrying a gold brick, gives it a thumbs-up.

197
00:12:43.981 --> 00:12:47.570
(narrator) Behind it, the crane sets its prebuilt module onto the building.

198
00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.822
(narrator) Then night falls: a deep blue sky, a full moon, and stars.

199
00:12:51.413 --> 00:12:54.013
npm install left-pad?

200
